### Describe the bug

I found a memory leak using zenoh-cpp 1.9.0 with zenoh-pico 1.9.0 as backend.
For a simple test which has one session, one pub, one sub and I put one message and the sub receives it. The test runs succesfully, but under address sanitizer I get memory leaks.

### To reproduce

